<view class="captain-game-page captain-game-manage">
  <view class="captain-game-nav"><button class="captain-game-nav-back" bindtap="onHeaderBack" aria-label="返回">‹</button><text>管理球局</text><text class="captain-game-fixture">CAPTAIN_OPEN_GAME_FIXTURE</text></view>
  <scroll-view scroll-y="true" class="captain-game-scroll">
    <view class="captain-game-notice"><text>{{fixtureNotice}}</text></view>
    <view class="captain-game-card"><text class="captain-game-heading">{{visualState === 'DRAFT' ? '私有草稿' : visualState === 'PUBLISHED' ? '已发布' : visualState === 'CANCELLED' ? '球局已取消' : visualState}}</text><text wx:if="{{visualState === 'DRAFT'}}">仅你可见，尚未公开或分享。</text><text wx:if="{{visualState === 'PUBLISHED'}}">公开详情已可查看；申请功能尚未开放。</text><text wx:if="{{visualState === 'CANCELLED'}}">本次开放球局已取消；真实订场、订单和退款状态均未改变。</text></view>
    <view class="captain-game-card"><text class="captain-game-card-title">真实订场已确认</text><text class="captain-game-heading">{{order.venue}}</text><text>{{order.pitch}} · {{order.date}} · {{order.time}}</text><text>{{order.booking}}</text></view>
    <view class="captain-game-card"><text class="captain-game-heading">球局概要</text><text>计划 {{snapshot.total}} 人 · 固定 {{snapshot.fixed}} 人 · 开放 {{snapshot.open}} 人</text><text>{{snapshot.intensity}} · {{snapshot.positions}}</text><text>预计 AA：{{snapshot.aa}} · {{snapshot.visibility}}</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{shareError}}" class="captain-game-inline-error" role="alert">{{shareError}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{visualState === 'DRAFT'}}" class="captain-game-actions"><button class="captain-game-primary" bindtap="onPublish">发布球局</button><button class="captain-game-secondary" bindtap="onPreview">预览公开详情</button><button class="captain-game-secondary" bindtap="onEdit">编辑球局</button><button class="captain-game-danger" bindtap="onAbandon">放弃草稿</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{visualState === 'PUBLISHED'}}" class="captain-game-actions"><button class="captain-game-primary" bindtap="onShare">分享球局</button><button class="captain-game-secondary" bindtap="onPreview">查看公开页</button><button class="captain-game-secondary" bindtap="onEdit">编辑球局</button><button class="captain-game-danger" bindtap="onCancel">取消球局</button></view>
    <button wx:if="{{visualState === 'CANCELLED'}}" class="captain-game-secondary" bindtap="onReturnOrder">返回订单</button>
  </scroll-view>
  <view wx:if="{{panel === 'publish'}}" class="captain-game-scrim"><view class="captain-game-sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><text class="captain-game-heading">发布前确认</text><text>真实场地：{{order.venue}} · {{order.pitch}}</text><text>开放名额：{{snapshot.open}} 人 · 预计 AA：{{snapshot.aa}}</text><text>到场线下结算，平台不代收或担保。</text><text>报名截止：{{snapshot.deadline}} · {{snapshot.visibility}}</text><button class="captain-game-secondary" bindtap="onClosePanel">返回修改</button><button class="captain-game-primary" bindtap="onConfirmPublish">确认发布</button></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{panel === 'cancel'}}" class="captain-game-scrim"><view class="captain-game-sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><text class="captain-game-heading">确认取消球局</text><text>只取消本次开放球局，不会取消已预订场地，也不会发起退款。</text><button class="captain-game-secondary" bindtap="onClosePanel">继续保留</button><button class="captain-game-danger" bindtap="onConfirmCancel">确认取消球局</button></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{panel === 'abandon'}}" class="captain-game-scrim"><view class="captain-game-sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><text class="captain-game-heading">确认放弃草稿</text><text>草稿不会公开，也不会影响已预订场地。</text><button class="captain-game-secondary" bindtap="onClosePanel">继续保留</button><button class="captain-game-danger" bindtap="onConfirmAbandon">确认放弃草稿</button></view></view>
  <text class="captain-game-hidden-copy">暂时无法分享</text>
</view>
